"source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L236-279", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The signature is over a 0-ALGO self-payment whose note is the nonce \u2014 verified and discarded, never broadcast, so signing in costs nothing and needs no balance. Returns a 7-day JWT to be treated as a bearer secret."}, {"id": "docs_api_get_wallet", "label": "GET /wallet", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L281-324", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The one thing a session is for. A headless client typically has no session and cannot call it; credit surfaces to it instead via billing.creditAtomic on a successful rent and the 402 insufficient_credit body."}, {"id": "docs_api_get_lease_id", "label": "GET /lease/:id (status)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L331-359", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "expiresAt is when credit runs out at the current rate and moves when you top up; graceUntil turning non-null is the only warning before the sandbox is destroyed, so poll this if you care about not losing work."}, {"id": "docs_api_delete_x402_leases_id", "label": "DELETE /x402/leases/:id (release)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L361-388", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Free and safe to call twice. This is when compute is billed \u2014 nothing was taken when the session opened. Alias: POST /lease/:id/release."}, {"id": "docs_api_three_credentials", "label": "Three independent credentials (session, lease, payment)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L63-74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "None of the three is required to pay, because payment identifies itself. A session grants reading your own balance; a lease token grants status/run/release for one lease; a payment grants the paid action, with the payer being the transaction's sender."}, {"id": "docs_api_error_index", "label": "Plain HTTP error index", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L423-450", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every error is {\"error\": \"<code>\"}, some with detail or extra fields such as minimum, maximum or txid."}, {"id": "docs_api_atomic_units_convention", "label": "Atomic-unit amount convention", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L13-14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All amounts are integer atomic units of USDC (6 decimals) \u2014 strings where they cross the wire in x402 payloads, numbers in the plain endpoints, because a JSON number cannot carry a uint64 safely."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_api_get_platform", "target": "docs_x402_api_post_topup", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L119", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_get_health", "target": "docs_x402_api_post_rent_nodeid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L392-401", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_three_credentials", "target": "docs_api_post_auth_wallet_login", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L67-71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_post_auth_wallet_login", "target": "docs_api_get_auth_wallet_nonce", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api.md", "source_location": "L236-249", "weight": 1.0}, {"sou